# ~/.herdr-hive/clickup/taxonomy.tsv — the tags hive accepts, one taxonomy for every front.
# Tab-separated: kind, tag, definition, epic (area only: the epic 'ct new' suggests as parent), default front.
# kind: front (exactly one per task), module (at least one), area (exactly one), type (at most one).
# A new module or area is one line here; 'hive ct sync' creates the tags missing from the space.
kind	tag	definition	epic	default front
front	front-default	Tasks the default front's coordinator leads.		default
front	front-web	Tasks the web front's coordinator leads.		web
module	mod-api	The public HTTP API and its workers.		default
module	mod-web	The web frontend.		web
module	mod-db	Database schema, migrations and data repairs.		default
module	mod-infra	Clusters, deployment, secrets and helper services.		default
area	area-billing	Invoices, payments and refunds end to end.	abc123def	default
area	area-search	Product search: indexing, ranking and the search page.		web
area	area-platform	Shared plumbing: builds, deployment, observability.		default
area	area-other	Work with no lasting area.		default
type	type-analysis	An analysis: done once delivered, it points at or creates the tasks that carry it out.
